eals a former smoking habit that was discontinued May 2024, and the patient consumes approximately 10 alcoholic drinks per week. Additionally, her father had a myocardial infarction at the age of 66, but he is no longer living.\n\n • Follow-up care is crucial for ongoing management and monitoring of her breast cancer, and adherence to the prescribed medication is essential for her treatment plan.\n"
